  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-learns-to-swim-v1.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "6df8e93f851d777b0fbc44e1438bf0698dc6eea62bedda54c4f0660fef62ff89",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dd3f3b13b7f4dd9f4b999a69e730054d20c969c5150680fc73c26eb659e6f6a4",
      "text": "Wukong Learns\nto Swim",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4331abf14d927f5c51b4a7d3abdf72679c9b9983cc094970c58f385d02ceb8e6",
      "text": "Ao Bing swims beside the\ncoach.\n“I want to swim, too!” says\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "29fafc54353533f6760f2e488dd2fac6952a49fe0ed63629cffcae0fb40673a4",
      "text": "But his toes curl at the pool.\n“I feel a little scared.”\n“We can go slowly,” says the\ncoach.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8483836837456b3fae511221568cfa94e98c76c7b09071b8c39d3c50b8e8a7bc",
      "text": "Sandy sits close to the pool.\nThe coach holds out a hand.\n“Ready?” Wukong nods.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c437295be48ba1efbde9104dfbbd541dd4e7c0bf4f0d4a96ab3c6a91f4ea0bee",
      "text": "Wukong holds the pool edge.\nThe coach stays right beside\nhim.\nAo Bing makes a tiny splash.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9c6b4104dcea6f5696e46fdbce833d809b1b6502b41ec578473deace6126911b",
      "text": "Three toys bob in the pool.\nA shark, a starfish, a\nclownfish!\n“Hello, little fish!” says\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "93b2a90f88d49c7c8048b97b4f304b957535fe0f207be0b4305ee8fe7b348234",
      "text": "The coach lifts a foam\nbarbell.\nIt has big blue ends.\n“Do fish lift weights?” asks\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "86596039fe363f147f1c0211c2ead10d38de7af3fa8117efc859ec7214514b1b",
      "text": "“This one helps us practice.”\nWukong grins, but holds the\nedge.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e5d71882ccf3cb19f2564e03c0b919b582dbf9be24e73cb72db1881c6a5c8690",
      "text": "The coach blows little\nbubbles.\nWukong tries to blow bubbles,\ntoo.\nPop, pop, pop!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2d16a6291dbbc78ac80b8ea25aaabbc7168e3eeac418693f5890a386dfc520c6",
      "text": "Water tickles his chin.\nHe lifts his face and blinks.\n“A little rest,” says the\ncoach.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ac803254d050b04e66b67f23d780a9ba1ee5f49319876e5790539ef64f4c32bd",
      "text": "Wukong comes back for\nanother lesson.\nHe makes more bubbles at the\nedge.\n“My bubbles are back!” he\nsays.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7f62d12a8c1c689f3ad25d353058512c77db43e87deb78e8a3d936eefe560a2f",
      "text": "“Can you help me float?”\n“Yes,” says the coach.\n“I am holding you.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "617b524c3de1217ed553e7bf7b482d8e5031998e02ff67cd2d16b01f6111c412",
      "text": "Wukong starts to float with\nhelp.\nHis belly bobs like a boat.\n“A boat with a tail!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "85fc7926dfc19bfdb6f3fd517c0ad404007c288446511bf8fab443af0e7c5775",
      "text": "At another lesson, Wukong\ntries little kicks.\n“Legs straight. Knees soft,”\nsays the coach.\nWukong stretches his legs\nbehind him.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5b092a05654e8ddb78dd364ec83a613d9b777da602bed73a97f5915c2574426",
      "text": "“Soft knees. Little kicks.”\nHis feet make small splashes.\n“The shark is watching!” says\nAo Bing.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b55ad200910268600bfbfc8b54c318e1330d7c10f0a3c15e1e6dc9b45f22edd3",
      "text": "Wukong holds the foam\nbarbell.\n“Head down. Look into the\nwater.”\nHe blows bubbles and kicks.\nThe coach supports him.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "085befded411fc1021a0a3ef58043bf09241786763ed4850b9bde7561fbb0911",
      "text": "After more lessons, Wukong\ntries without it.\n“You are right here?”\n“Right here,” says the coach.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f70937e5655c4ebca466902a219ff47bbfa4ae85a7f158fd343dd7f65f6c8563",
      "text": "He swims a little way.\nThe coach stays within reach.\nWukong turns to hold the pool\nedge.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-19.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "72a64613c58b4f9a2760ab01968fdda3eddd2797d2905470489d6877073938a0",
      "text": "“I swam a little way!” says\nWukong.\n“You did!” says Ao Bing.\nThe coach helps Wukong out.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-20.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "015c0113c79f86efd3a4d4c8f5de3702f56208d14491440d37757e3b81de5623",
      "text": "Three toys go in the basket.\n“Good night, little shark.”\n“You had a busy lesson, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-21.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b6f14abd05c0cd0e1ecc06a7a775d666ab6e243347598fcce36a91498c2c38c0",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed this story, you are welcome\nto support more. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStory and art made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
